			String _name = "EBSVOilPressTip";
			String _text = "The Village Oil Press produces 14 to 18 Vegetable Oil from 25 Kernels and 1 Amphora, 14 to 18 Seed Oil from 25 Pecan, or 25 Walnut and 1 Amphora or 14 to 18 Linseed Oil from 25 Flax and 1 Amphora. Up to 2 Pressers can be employed to produce 18 to 24 Seed Oil from either Pecan or Walnut, produce 18 to 24 Vegetable Oil from 50 Kernels, produce 18 to 24 Linseed Oil from 50 Flax. Build Cycles: 48. 2 F Key Color Variations.";
